Acknowledgments

The decision to ship a deterministic CI-time linter for Supabase + Next.js apps
was informed by deepsec (https://github.com/vercel-labs/deepsec), Apache License
2.0, Copyright Vercel Labs.

supacheck is a complementary tool. deepsec runs as an on-demand LLM-driven
audit; supacheck runs as a deterministic CI gate on every PR. No code is
copied from deepsec; this project ships independent implementations of distinct
rules that deepsec's architecture either skips (migrations) or does not cover
(Supabase-specific patterns).
